  "contentHtml": "<div class=\"xiangqingchakan\"> \n <p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">各单位、各位师生：</span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"margin-bottom:8px; text-align:left; text-indent:28.0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">为进一步优化校园办事服务流程，提升办事效率，学校师生综合服务大厅已正式运行工作。根据学校统一工作安排，人事处以下涉及教职工保险待遇申领相关业务自2026年8月21日（星期五）起调整到师生综合服务大厅A2窗口办理。</span></span></span></span></p> \n <p style=\"margin-bottom:8px; text-align:left; text-indent:28.0pt\"> </p> \n <table align=\"center\" class=\"MsoTableGrid\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; border-width: medium; border-style: none; border-color: currentcolor; border-image: initial; width: 612px;\"> \n  <tbody> \n   <tr> \n    <td style=\"border-bottom:1px solid black; width:37px; padding:0cm 7px 0cm 7px; border-top:1px solid black; border-right:1px solid black; border-left:1px solid black\"> <p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"line-height:120%\"><span style=\"vertical-align:middle\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><b><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"line-height:120%\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"color:black\">序号</span></span></span></span></b></span></span></span></span></p> </td> \n    <td style=\"border-width: 1px 1px 1px medium; border-style: solid solid solid none; border-color: black black black currentcolor; width: 406px; padding: 0cm 7px;\"> <p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt\"><span style=\"line-height:120%\"><span style=\"vertical-align:middle\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><b><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt\"><span style=\"line-height:120%\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"color:black\">师生服务大厅进驻事项名称</span></span></span></span></b></s